/Subject (A single T\055Pot honeypot recorded one continuous RedTail campaign between 2026\05509\05516 and 2026\05509\05528 on five vectors\072 SSH\054 Telnet\054 HTTP\054 HTTPS and the Docker API\056 The report documents the evidence for one operation\054 the Telnet infection path\054 the detection gap under the ET Open ruleset\054 and recommendations for defenders\056)
